# @desc   From the Inbox tab, open the chat or report matching TARGET_CHAT in the LHN. Triggers the ManualOpenReport Sentry span (LHN row press -> report screen mounted with composer visible). Assumes the user is signed in with at least one chat in the Inbox.
# @pre    id="BaseSidebarScreen"
# @pre    id="searchButton" || role="button" label="Search"
# @post   label="Write something..." editable=true
# @reset  .claude/skills/agent-device/flows/macros/return-to-inbox.ad
# @span   ManualOpenReport
# @param  TARGET_CHAT Exact accessible label of the report or chat row to open from the Inbox LHN.

is exists "id=\"BaseSidebarScreen\""
is exists "id=\"searchButton\" || role=\"button\" label=\"Search\""
press "role=\"button\" label=\"${TARGET_CHAT}\" || label=\"${TARGET_CHAT}\" hittable=true"
wait "label=\"Write something...\" editable=true" 10000
